+## Local experiment - 2026-09-25 (not released)
+
+- Added opt-in `--tiered-pack` cold Q4_K storage with bounded lane buffers,
+  source/geometry checks and scalar/SSSE3 expansion. Lossy; expanded cache size
+  is unchanged. See `docs/tiered-storage.md`.
+- Added `--choices-only` for final single-token labels from rendered prompts,
+  including per-question time and physical expert read bytes. Existing defaults
+  and ordinary perplexity behavior remain unchanged.
+
